# ChimeraX: DSSP (Kabsch-Sander) secondary structure for residues 476-490 of 2VGB chain A
# Run from the analysis/structure folder: ChimeraX --nogui --exit --script scripts/09_chimerax_dssp.cxc  (UCSF ChimeraX 1.10.1)
open raw/2VGB.cif
dssp #1 report true
info residues #1/A:476-490 attribute ss_type
info residues #1/A:476-490 attribute ss_id
